<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The flow of securities stripped by sector, shown in the next chart, is highly correlated with the stock of securities that are stripped, shown above. The chart also illustrates that there is substantial reconstitution of securities from STRIPS, so that on average, $1,827&nbsp;million in Treasuries were stripped each day from July 2024 to June 2025 and $1,567 million reconstituted.</p>



