		<title>The Regional Side of the Story: K&#8209;Shaped Pattern in Region, Wider Gap in Gas Spending</title>
		<link>https://libertystreeteconomics.newyorkfed.org/2026/05/the-regional-side-of-the-story-k-shaped-pattern-in-region-wider-gap-in-gas-spending/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Inequality]]></category>
