		<title>Explaining the K&#8209;Shaped Economy: What’s Behind the Divide?</title>
		<link>https://libertystreeteconomics.newyorkfed.org/2026/05/explaining-the-k-shaped-economy-whats-behind-the-divide/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[]]></dc:creator>
