<p class="is-style-related-reading wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Author Brief   </strong></p>



<p class="is-style-bio-contact wp-block-paragraph">“The recent growth in consumption has not been broad based. Rather, it has been driven by the high-income households.”</p>



<p class="is-style-related-reading wp-block-paragraph">—Raji Chakrabarti, coauthor</p>



