<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Final Words</h4>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our measures present a mixed picture of trends in banking system vulnerabilities in recent years. While uniformly lower than the high levels seen in the run-up to the 2008–09 financial crisis, some of the measures have been higher in recent years than the low levels attained between 2015 and 2020.</p>



